{
  "info": {
    "name": "Karachi App \u2014 Blood Response System",
    "description": "Full API collection: auth (with real TOTP MFA), donors, blood requests, matching engine, hospitals, blood banks + inventory, notifications, AI agent, and admin dashboard/analytics.\n\nQUICK START:\n1. Run every request under 'Auth' top to bottom, in order (Register x5, then Login x5). Tokens auto-save to collection variables.\n2. Then run 'Donors > Create My Donor Profile', 'Admin > (via adminToken) Verify Donor'.\n3. Then run the 'Blood Requests' folder top to bottom for the full lifecycle: create -> submit -> verify -> match -> start -> fulfill.\n4. Explore Hospitals, Blood Banks, Notifications, Admin folders any time after Auth.\n\nAll IDs (donorId, requestId, hospitalId, bankId, etc.) are captured automatically by test scripts \u2014 you don't need to copy-paste anything.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
